# promote.yaml clones the dev repo into _dev/ inside this working tree.
# It must never be committed: because that clone carries its own .git, `git add -A`
# records it as a submodule gitlink (mode 160000) with no matching .gitmodules,
# which makes every later checkout cleanup fail with
# "fatal: No url found for submodule path '_dev' in .gitmodules".
_dev/